  "bodyHash": "68adde97e5c4c3a2",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span>建議搭配 JEI 遊玩</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>生物：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><span>共有兩種非極限模式的實體，包括：</span>\n<p><span>冰元素：生成於雪地生物群落（不含雪灘）與冰封生物群落<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/948751/description_8a9d0546-0a88-49c1-8ac4-e3556c22aae7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"251\" height=\"251\"><br></span><span>熔岩元素：生成於地獄與沙漠。<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/948751/description_82f20193-6098-4faa-8584-be00bff5ca88.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"253\" height=\"253\"><br></span></p>\n<span>有三種僅限極限模式的專屬生物：</span>\n<p><span>預兆者：擊殺任何生物（包含其他預兆者）後有 25% 機率生成<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/948751/description_658afbb5-b00d-4eaf-99b8-9386baf8c5cb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"280\" height=\"280\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span>冰封毀滅者：取代冰元素生成<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/948751/description_1ae6bba7-3767-4f53-8920-3a4e2a4914b6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"258\" height=\"258\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span>熔岩毀滅者：取代熔岩元素生成<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/948751/description_f639f391-202c-4c3a-8e05-8e1fa87cc764.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"262\" height=\"262\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span>共有三種首領生物：</span></p>\n<p><span>大裁決官：單一階段<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/948751/description_5e4457a3-cf57-474a-8579-09ab3e4ff0d7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"272\" height=\"272\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span>碎盾者札諾克：兩個階段<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/948751/description_c82279fe-6ec5-4572-a55b-6dd67b17f7b5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\"><br></span><span><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/948751/description_714f30ad-294d-4b8b-a4df-aa17cc167ad9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"275\"></span></p>\n<p><span>破碎者伊芬尼魯斯：三個階段<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/948751/description_c92983df-e160-4840-aa76-7f62b5c5abc5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"280\" height=\"280\"><br><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/948751/description_902d83b2-e75c-40b0-a655-dd56c43ab4bd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"280\" height=\"280\"><br><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/948751/description_830f693d-8b3d-4d98-b46e-44b10578b68a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"280\" height=\"280\"><br></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span>極限模式會移除的方塊：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h6><span>它會移除分體式盔甲。</span></h6>\n</div>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span>新增項目：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>暗劍、暗矛、暗甲、自訂生物模型盔甲、成就進度線（與多數模組類似），以及六種附魔。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
